  "ingredients": [
    "4 cups sifted confectioners' sugar",
    "1.5 cups creamy peanut butter",
    "0.5 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "6 ounces semi-sweet chocolate chips",
    "2 tablespoons shortening"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Line a baking sheet with waxed paper; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MuHB7TCawITylZdF8K-KtDkdf3w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15171-buckeye-balls-ii-DDMFS-step-1-ec055b9aba074c90a69ad61adfc7f043.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15171/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine confectioners' sugar, peanut butter, butter, and vanilla in a large bowl; mix together with your hands to form a smooth stiff dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mfPI2pDLAqy-Ld8Sof3Yx58-b0E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15171-buckeye-balls-ii-DDMFS-step-2-517774b2e96245db9f45b0ac1896156e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15171/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shape into balls using 2 teaspoons of dough for each ball. Place on the prepared baking sheet and refrigerate until ready to coat with chocolate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1g8Bm6ySLoWDcwZOSuXF2g8T-vc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15171-buckeye-balls-ii-DDMFS-step-3-479bf5e24e17488b9b20a46d601e21ab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15171/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine chocolate chips and shortening in a metal bowl over a pot of simmering water. Stir occasionally until melted and smooth. Remove from the heat. Remove chilled peanut butter balls from the refrigerator.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G_-je6esZwZ-2Z7C-xdtVy9qGAg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15171-buckeye-balls-ii-DDMFS-step-4-e2caf0bfa2ec4b3397ccd01c1db2c06a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15171/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Insert a wooden toothpick into a ball, and dip into the melted chocolate until coated. Return to the baking sheet, chocolate-side down, and remove the toothpick.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BtEb34F4ZZDWV0AO-K4bRPDAms8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15171-buckeye-balls-ii-DDMFS-step-5-15e635a14e6a47a19c0afac0fb0faf13.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15171/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Repeat Step 5 to coat remaining balls. Refrigerate coated balls until set, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/s0zrHTFdOk26HjNL-1FZ8Ax5Ujg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15171-buckeye-balls-ii-DDMFS-4x3-514f5b6ddb2945a6844dc0f92673e7ec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15171/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
